    - target: {fileID: 4989890030215801003, guid: 12b022ca108b63653b3636eaf8bcd491, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'noteText.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'I have stacked wood for the Knights a number of times but I have never
        seen this room. Time has stopped down here in the dark. Must have been days
        since I came down here. I am hungry. Food has been left down here in my sleep.
        Although John whispered through the door: that tuna sandwich was my last
        meal.


        I gotta find a way out and stop those Knights.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4989890030215801003, guid: 12b022ca108b63653b3636eaf8bcd491, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'noteText.Array.data[1]'
